1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,810
Move it, Fisher.
We need to get the hell out of here now.

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:03,880
Sam?

3
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:06,460
What's going on, Lambert?

4
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:19,750
I broke the news
when I pulled him out of Iceland.

5
00:00:20,190 --> 00:00:21,950
He didn't take it well.

6
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:23,230
Nobody would.

7
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:25,570
Losing their own flesh and blood.

8
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:28,710
And he'd never be the same again.

9
00:00:59,050 --> 00:01:02,770
They say if it doesn't kill you,
it makes you stronger.

10
00:01:03,730 --> 00:01:05,950
Well, Sam didn't die.

11
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:09,000
He had nothing to lose anymore.

12
00:01:09,070 --> 00:01:12,030
So he took the most dangerous
mission of his career.

13
00:01:14,150 --> 00:01:16,770
That's how he ended up
in Ellsworth Penitentiary.

14
00:01:17,870 --> 00:01:20,380
He was treated the same as anybody else.

15
00:01:20,450 --> 00:01:22,520
No better, no worse.

16
00:01:22,590 --> 00:01:25,450
It was no midnight run, for damn sure.

17
00:01:27,980 --> 00:01:30,330
He didn't need much help
to look like hell.

18
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:33,340
Not since Sarah, his daughter, was killed.

19
00:01:37,960 --> 00:01:40,810
You hate to see a good man fall so far.

20
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:42,180
Is that all you got?

21
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:43,280
Come on!

22
00:01:49,510 --> 00:01:53,690
Me? I hoped this mission would let him
pull himself back together.

23
00:01:54,110 --> 00:01:55,530
We needed him.

24
00:01:56,950 --> 00:01:57,950
Prison.

25
00:01:58,070 --> 00:02:00,810
A hell of a place to save a man's life.
